            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "soupisgoodfood33"
            },
            "reviewBody": "I put this on chicken legs and we cooked them on the charcoal grill. I used salted butter and omitted the salt called for in the recipe. I didnt try one but my husband liked them alot he ate 4 and a hamburger.",
            "datePublished": "2012-05-28T17:16:32.570Z"
